Build Akal, a responsive social platform, in this repository.

First inspect the repository and any AGENTS.md instructions. If no application exists, initialize a Next.js app with TypeScript and Tailwind CSS.

Create an MVP with:
- A home feed with text and image posts
- User profiles with bios and follower counts
- Post creation, likes, comments, and bookmarks
- Search for people and posts
- Notifications
- Responsive navigation for mobile and desktop
- Accessible components and light/dark themes

Use a clean, distinctive visual design with readable typography and thoughtful spacing. Use realistic sample content.

Start with local mock data and working interactions. Clearly identify features that require a backend; do not present simulated authentication or persistence as production-ready.

Implement the app, run the available build and checks, fix failures, and verify the main user flows. Finish with startup instructions and a concise explanation of what works and what remains.
